{"unit_id":"QT-Chen__dsh-mic-input#card-zh","repo":"QT-Chen/dsh-mic-input","commit":"92d6dec9ad8226cc2fd38a91c628bdf47e71a95f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mic-input 是一款面向 DSH Web 的浏览器语音输入插件。它将麦克风按钮放入对话输入框旁，并在通用设置中提供语言、标点和自动发送选项。点击按钮即可开始听写，识别结果会实时写入草稿；手动停止后保留转写文本，也可选择自动提交。插件使用浏览器的 Web Speech API，支持跟随系统语言、中文和英语，并可自动续听、避免部分重复文本和补全句末标点。适合希望直接口述 DSH 消息的 Web 用户。使用时需浏览器支持语音识别并授予麦克风权限；无需插件 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:111-146","lib/client.js:148-203","lib/client.js:275-323"]}
{"unit_id":"QT-Chen__dsh-mic-input#card-en","repo":"QT-Chen/dsh-mic-input","commit":"92d6dec9ad8226cc2fd38a91c628bdf47e71a95f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-mic-input adds speech dictation to the DSH Web composer. Click its mic button to transcribe speech into the draft. Settings control language, punctuation, and optional auto-send. It uses the browser Web Speech API; a browser support and mic permission are required. No plugin API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:111-146","lib/client.js:148-203","lib/client.js:275-323"]}
